# =============================================================================
# GITHUB = R-Analysen + Report-PDF + aggregierte Abbildungen.
# Lokal bleiben: Mikrodaten, CSV-Tabellen, .rds, sowie WRITING/HANDOFF/LITERATURE/
# RESEARCH/human tasks und Office-Dokumente.
# =============================================================================

# ignore everything by default …
/*
# … then allow the repo basics
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/analysis/

# the online supplement (aggregated tables + figures + code copies; no microdata)
!/supplement/
!/supplement/**

# inside analysis/: ignore all, then re-allow code + report + figures
analysis/*
!analysis/*.R
!analysis/*.Rmd
!analysis/*.Rproj
!analysis/Wohnen_Hauptergebnisse.pdf
!analysis/output/
analysis/output/*
!analysis/output/*.png

# never, under any circumstances (defense in depth)
*.sav
*.dta
*.rds
*.RData
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.Renviron
